        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>ABH 0320 Center Hung Top Pivot Hinge</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis medium duty center hung top pivot hinge (for the top of the door only) is engineered for durability on standard doors.  These are used standard with most center hung <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=519415\"><b>ABH Mfg Door Pivots</b></a> including <a href=\"/products/jamb-mounted-center-hung-pivot-set-abh-0127\"><b>ABH 0127 Door Pivot</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/floor-mounted-center-hung-pivot-set-abh-0128\"><b>ABH 0128 Door Pivot</b></a>.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ABH-0320_size.gif?v=1704354545\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ABH 0320 Center Hung Top Pivot Hinge Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSet includes top pivot, dress plate for jamb portion of door and installation hardware. <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=519415\"><b>ABH Door Pivots</b></a> are Made in the USA to insure high quality. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for ABH 0320 Top Door Pivot\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Weight: Up to 250 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Door Arm Length: 5-9/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Arm Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Full Mortise, Center Hung</li>\r\n<li>Walking beam type hinge</li>\r\n<li>Dress plate provided for jamb portion</li>\r\n<li><b>Non-Handed, Reversible </b></li>\r\n<li>BHMA/ANSI C06013/3500</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/0320-template.pdf?v=1691093120\" target=\"new\"><b>ABH 0320 Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually <b>\r\n</p>",
